OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry and
OL,6,Fbright evening for most before heavy
OL,7,Frain and low cloud push northeastwards
OL,8,Fwith Storm Austen. Rain slightly
OL,9,Feasing in the south towards dawn.
OL,10,FWindy for a time during the early
OL,11,Fhours.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FOutbreaks of heavy and
OL,14,Fpersistent rain continue to move
OL,15,Fnortheastwards through the day. Winds
OL,16,Fquickly picking up through the morning
OL,17,Fwith gales likely along western coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
