OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FStrong
OL,6,Fwinds and heavy rain from Storm Boelo
OL,7,FSaturday, before moving away to leave
OL,8,Fsunny spells with isolated showers on
OL,9,FSunday. Further wind and rain arrives
OL,10,Fovernight into Monday.
